    "chunk_text": "yrnadne sticcan, sete on \u00feone n\u00e6gl wi\u00f0 \u00fea wearta, sleah \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t Wi\u00fe gic\u00fean, doccan & wyrm melu & sealt, ealra emfela, meng wi\u00f0 sure fletan & smire mid \u00fey. Wi\u00fe gic\u00fean, nim sciptearo & ifigtearo & ele, gnid tog\u00e6dere, do \u00feriddan d\u00e6l sealtes, smire mid \u00fey. Gif \u00feu wille \u00fe\u00e6t yfel swile ra\u00f0e utberste nim weax & hemlic hatte wyrt, gebeat gewyrmed tosomne, Gif men unlust sie getenge nime betonican \u00fe\u00e6t wille \u00fery penegas gewegan, drinc on swetum Gif mon fram longum wege geteorod sie drince betonican on \u00feam su\u00f0renan, oxumelle, \u00fe\u00e6t Wi\u00fe \u00feon \u00fee mon hine fordrince, drince betonican on w\u00e6tre \u00e6r o\u00feerne drincan. Eft, wyl betonican & eor\u00f0 geallan on hluttrum eala\u00f0 o\u00fe\u00fee on swilcre w\u00e6tan swa he drincan scyle, Eft, genim swines lungenne, gebr\u00e6d & on neaht nestig genim fif sn\u00e6da simle. Wi\u00fe miclan cele nim netelan, seo\u00fe on ele, smire & gnid ealne \u00feinne lichoman mid. Se cyle gewit aweg. Gif men sie micel w\u00e6ce getenge, popig gegnid on ele, smire \u00feinne andwlitan mid & \u00feone lichoman Wundorlice ra\u00fee him bi\u00fe sio w\u00e6cce gemetgod. To monnes stemne nim cerfillan & wuducerfillan, bisceopwyrt, ontran, grundeswelgean, wyrc to Nim \u00fereo sn\u00e6da buteran, gemenge wi\u00f0 hw\u00e6ten mela & g",
